OL,3,GNEWSAA grumpy cloud and a happy sun -
OL,4,Athe book that catches children's
OL,5,Afeelings using weather
OL,6,
OL,7,FA group of primary school pupils have
OL,8,Fcome together to turn their ideas about
OL,9,Ffeelings and emotions into a book
OL,10,Fdesigned to help young people
OL,11,Funderstand their mental health.
OL,13,FThe Weather Catcher was co-created by
OL,14,FYear Six pupils from Glencraig
OL,15,FIntegrated Primary School and Holywood
OL,16,FPrimary school, using weather to help
OL,17,Fchildren understand that feelings can
OL,18,Fchange from day to day.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
