OL,3,GNEWSAA grumpy cloud and a happy sun -
OL,4,Athe book that catches children's
OL,5,Afeelings using weather
OL,6,
OL,7,FThrough a series of workshops organised
OL,8,Fby Action Mental Health, Illustrator
OL,9,FEllan Rankin guided the children to use
OL,10,Fcolours, shapes and textures to
OL,11,Frepresent their emotions.
OL,13,FEleven-year-old Rafferty said he drew
OL,14,Finspiration from colours and elements
OL,15,Fof nature to convey different feelings.
